<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings fall in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings fall in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended August 17, roastings totaled approximately 350,000 60-kg bags, down from 395,000 in the previous week and compared with 335,000 in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 10,675,000 bags, versus 10,430,000 in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
